Oppose I think we should wait for the winter storm to finish and the final damage tally is announced before posting it.

Oppose Ten deaths in a winter storm is a low number of victims, whether it happens in the US, the UK or Italy. For now, it is not ITN-worthy as events of this kind are common and natural at this time of year in the northern hemisphere. We'll discuss it if it rises to an unbearable amount. We are not going to post every news story happening in the United States.   [LINK: (_-_Alsor) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:Alsor97]  ( [LINK: (talk) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User_talk:Alsor97] )  [LINK: (18:59, 25 January 2026 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:In_the_news/Candidates#c-Alsor97-20260125185900-Chorchapu-20260125185200] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:In_the_news/Candidates] ]

