Support alt3 I got out of NYC on a cruise the Friday before the storm, but my family and coworkers there were absolutely affected. Over a hundred deaths from a weather system, especially snow, is not routine, and is frankly insulting to the deaths of the people involved to consider that they are. People are still without power the better part of a week after this storm blowing through and there’s another one forming in the Atlantic and moving up the Northeast coast (where my cruise ship is sailing, cutting my vacation short) this weekend that may make this even worse (yes, yes CRYSTAL). This should’ve gone up days ago. - [LINK: (GhostStalker) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:GhostStalker]  ( [LINK: (Got a present for ya!) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User_talk:GhostStalker]  /  [LINK: (Mission Log) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:Contributions/GhostStalker] )  [LINK: (19:28, 30 January 2026 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:In_the_news/Candidates#c-GhostStalker-20260130192800-Chorchapu-20260125185200] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:In_the_news/Candidates] ]
