Support Youxia was considered the second most powerful person in CCP hierarchy. Having survived all previous anti-corruption "campaigns" (read purges) which targetted most of his colleagues, he finally bites the dust. This is very significant for China, and we should focus on the person rather than the nebulously large anti-corruption campaign. "Purge" can also simply be removed from mention for NPOV.  [LINK: (Gotitbro) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:Gotitbro]  ( [LINK: (talk) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User_talk:Gotitbro] )  [LINK: (05:55, 25 January 2026 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:In_the_news/Candidates#c-Gotitbro-20260125055500-Andrew_Davidson-20260124101900] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:In_the_news/Candidates] ]

