Nominators often include links to external websites and other references in discussions on this page. It is usually best to provide such links using the  [LINK: (inline URL syntax) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:External_Links#How_to_link]  [http://example.com] rather than using  [LINK: (<ref></ref> tags) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:CITE#How_to_format_inline_citations] , because that keeps all the relevant information in the same place as the nomination without having to jump to this section, and facilitates the archiving process.

